#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ha! Wrong! Think again, captain."
msgstr "Ha! Falsch! Denkt noch einmal nach, {crew|Kapitän|Kapitänin|Kapitäne|Kapitäninnen}."

#. what a judge says after the right answers, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grr! You know too much."
msgstr "Grr! Ihr wisst zu viel."

#. what a judge says after the right answers, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Go then, all of you... toll-free!"
msgstr "Dann geht, ihr alle... ohne Zoll!"

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the pilgrims to {port}."
