#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Count flees with his charter. Yellow gloves, a smell of violets, a wig too big, a ring with a "
"false seal."
msgstr ""
"Der Graf flieht mit seiner Urkunde. Gelbe Handschuhe, Veilchenduft, eine zu große Perücke, ein "
"Ring mit falschem Siegel."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Around 1600, perfumed gloves were the height of fashion. Gloves were scented with violets, roses "
"or amber, also to hide the smell of the leather."
msgstr ""
"Um 1600 waren duftende Handschuhe der letzte Schrei. Man parfümierte sie mit Veilchen, Rosen oder "
"Ambra, auch um den Geruch des Leders zu überdecken."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
